msgstr "Valore predefinito: 0"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2112
msgid ""
"Minimum area of a polygon to be considered valid, in selected units. Any "
"polygon with an area below this threshold is reported as error."
msgstr ""
"Area minima di un poligono affinché sia considerato valido, espressa nelle "
"unità selezionate. Qualsiasi poligono con un'area inferiore a tale soglia "
"viene segnalato come errore."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2114
#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2172
msgid "**Small polygons errors**"
msgstr "**Errori relativi a poligoni piccoli**"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2119
msgid ""
"Specification of the output layer containing centroid points of small "
"polygons. :ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"
msgstr ""
"Specifiche del layer risultato contenente i punti centroidi dei poligoni di "
"piccole dimensioni. :ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2125
#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2187
msgid "**Small polygons features**"
msgstr "**Elementi poligonali piccoli**"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2132
