msgstr "**ID algoritmo**: ``native:checkgeometrygap``"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2381
msgid "Small segments"
msgstr "Segmenti corti"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2384
msgid ""
"Calculates length of individual segments in line or polygon geometries, and "
"reports segments shorter than a minimum length as errors."
msgstr ""
"Calcola la lunghezza dei singoli segmenti nelle geometrie di linea o "
"poligono e segnala come errori i segmenti più corti di una lunghezza minima."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2390
msgid ""
"Reporting errors (in red) on single line segments shorter than the given "
"threshold."
msgstr ""
"Segnalazione degli errori (in rosso) sui singoli segmenti di linea più corti"
" della soglia specificata."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2417
msgid "**Minimum segment length**"
msgstr "**Lunghezza minima segmento**"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2418
msgid "``MIN_SEGMENT_LENGTH``"
msgstr "``MIN_SEGMENT_LENGTH``"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2422
msgid "Minimum length of segments to be considered valid, in map units."
msgstr ""
"Lunghezza minima dei segmenti da considerare validi, in unità cartografiche."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2423
#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2482
msgid "**Short segments errors**"
msgstr "**Errori relativi segmenti corti**"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2428
msgid ""
"Specification of the output layer containing centroid of short segments. "
":ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"
msgstr ""
"Specifiche del layer risultato contenente il centroide dei segmenti corti. "
":ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2434
#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2497
msgid "**Short segments features**"
msgstr "**Elementi segmenti corti**"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2441
msgid ""
"Specification of the output layer for features containing short segments. "
":ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"
msgstr ""
"Specifiche del layer risultato degli elementi contenenti segmenti corti. "
":ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2490
msgid ""
"``gc_partidx``: the index of the feature's geometry part containing the "
"small segment."
msgstr ""
"``gc_partidx``: l'indice della parte geometrica dell'elemento che contiene "
"il segmento di piccole dimensioni."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2491
msgid ""
"``gc_ringidx``: the index of the feature's geometry ring containing the "
"small segment."
msgstr ""
"``gc_ringidx``: l'indice dell'anello geometrico dell'elemento che contiene "
"il segmento corto."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2492
msgid ""
"``gc_vertidx``: the index of the end vertex of the small segment in the "
"feature's geometry ring."
msgstr ""
"``gc_vertidx``: l'indice del vertice terminale del segmento corto "
"nell'anello geometrico dell'elemento."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2493
msgid "``gc_errorx``: the x coordinate of the centroid of the small segment."
msgstr "``gc_errorx``: la coordinata x del centroide del segmento corto."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2494
msgid "``gc_errory``: the y coordinate of the centroid of the small segment."
msgstr "``gc_errory``: la coordinata y del centroide del segmento corto."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2495
msgid "``gc_error``: the error segment length."
msgstr "``gc_error``: la lunghezza del segmento interessato dall'errore."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2496
msgid ""
"``UNIQUE_ID`` field: the unique ID of the input feature with the small "
"segment."
msgstr ""
"Campo ``UNIQUE_ID``: l'ID univoco dell'elemento in ingresso con il segmento "
"corto."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2500
msgid ""
"Output layer containing, for each identified short segment, the feature it "
"belongs to. Available fields are the same as in the ``ERRORS`` output."
msgstr ""
"Layer risultato contenente, per ogni segmento corto identificato, l'elemento"
" a cui appartiene. I campi disponibili sono gli stessi presenti nell'output "
"``ERRORS``."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2506
msgid "**Algorithm ID**: ``native:checkgeometrysegmentlength``"
msgstr "**ID algoritmo**: ``native:checkgeometrysegmentlength``"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2517
msgid "Strictly multipart"
msgstr "**Effettivamente multiparte**"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2520
