msgid "**One-part geometry errors**"
msgstr "**Errori di geometria a una parte**"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2553
msgid ""
"Specification of the output layer containing centroid of the multipart "
"geometries that have only one part. :ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"
msgstr ""
"Specifiche dello layer risultato contenente il centroide delle geometrie "
"multiparte che ha una sola parte. :ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2559
#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2622
msgid "**One-part geometry features**"
msgstr "**Elementi con geometrie a una parte**"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2566
msgid ""
"Specification of the output layer for features containing multipart "
"geometries that have only one part. :ref:`One of <output_parameter_widget>`:"
msgstr ""
"Specifiche del layer risultato degli elementi contenenti geometrie composte "
"da più parti che hanno una sola parte. :ref:`One of "
"<output_parameter_widget>`:"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2618
msgid ""
"``gc_errorx``: the x coordinate of the centroid of the multipart geometry "
"that has only one part."
msgstr ""
"``gc_errorx``: la coordinata x del centroide della geometria multiparte che "
"contiene una sola parte."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2619
msgid ""
"``gc_errory``: the y coordinate of the centroid of the multipart geometry "
"that has only one part."
msgstr ""
"``gc_errory``: la coordinata y del centroide della geometria multiparte che "
"contiene una sola parte."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/checkgeometry.rst:2621
msgid ""
"``UNIQUE_ID`` field: the unique ID of the input feature that is multipart "
"but has only one part."
msgstr ""
